      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I trust you\u2019ve read the news on social media. Mayor of Sokay, D.R.R,
    is running for the Presidency. \r\n\r\nPick out status posts that highlight D.R.R,
    his mayoralty and Republika in a positive light. You may also come across posts
    that share the reality of other candidates' uncouth behaviour. Amplify their
    reach and create engagement with a repost or like. Lead opinion. \r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve
    provided a router and SIM for you to use. You will be compensated in-line with
    your performance.\r\n\r\nYou have 5 working days until the election. Make those
    hours count.\r\n\r\nTo God be the glory.\r\n\r\nFrom the desk of H.E. delos Santos\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99ceef68d2979d94cb23d910cfad40a0, type: 2}
